// Database: mitre — the MITRE CAR model, MATERIALIZED (epic #86)
//
// The pipeline NORMALISES each evidence source into finished CAR events
// (PIIAT-MitreCar: one car.db per source, one row per event) and exports one
// `car_<object>.jsonl` per populated object plus `car_relationships.jsonl` (the
// superset relationship instances). Those files are ingested here, 1:1, as the
// `mitre.car_<object>` tables + `mitre.car_relationships` below — the JSON IS the
// ADX contract.
//
// This REPLACES the former query-time model (the CarX() / Car<Object>_<Artefact>()
// functions that rebuilt each object from host/network/memory at query time).
// Extraction now happens ONCE, in the engine, with its own test suite; KQL just
// stores the result. No backwards-compatible views are kept.
//
// COLUMN NAMES ARE BRACKET-QUOTED. Many CAR fields collide with KQL keywords
// (from, to, type, data, key, value, user, group, ...), a syntax error as bare
// column names in .create table — the same trap 00-databases.kql documents for
// the `network` database name. ['name'] is always valid, so every column is
// bracketed rather than guessing which are safe.
//
// SHAPE (object tables): car_object (constant per table) + the common CAR header
// (timestamp, car_action, guid, owning_guid, link_confidence, source_artefact,
// source_host) + native (dynamic) + the object's MITRE fields as nullable
// strings. Numeric-looking fields stay string (evidence is type-inconsistent);
// cast at query time as memory.VolatilityJson does.
//
// GENERATED from the engine's object model (store.HEADER + each object's fields)
// plus the relationship export schema. Re-derive rather than hand-editing.

//=============================================================================
// car_authentication
//=============================================================================
.create-merge table car_authentication (
    ['car_object']:string,
    ['timestamp']:datetime,
    ['car_action']:string,
    ['guid']:string,
    ['owning_guid']:string,
    ['link_confidence']:string,
    ['source_artefact']:string,
    ['source_host']:string,
    ['native']:dynamic,
    ['app_name']:string,
    ['method']:string,
    ['auth_service']:string,
    ['auth_target']:string,
    ['target_ad_domain']:string,
    ['decision_reason']:string,
    ['response_time']:string,
    ['fqdn']:string,
    ['hostname']:string,
    ['ad_domain']:string,
    ['uid']:string,
    ['user_role']:string,
    ['user_type']:string,
    ['user']:string,
    ['user_agent']:string,
    ['target_uid']:string,
    ['target_user_role']:string,
    ['target_user_type']:string,
    ['target_user']:string
)

